This repository embeds, and its release archives bundle, third-party software.

Embedded in this repository

- Ghostty (libghostty-vt), compiled to WebAssembly as
  internal/guest/vt/assets/ghostty-vt.wasm.
  MIT License, Copyright (c) 2024 Mitchell Hashimoto, Ghostty contributors.
  License text: internal/guest/vt/assets/GHOSTTY-LICENSE.
  Source commit and build command: internal/guest/vt/assets/ghostty-vt.build.json.

Bundled in release archives

Release archives ship a runtime bundle built from the sources pinned in
scripts/release/inputs/pins.json. License texts are in scripts/release/licenses,
and every release attaches the libkrun, libkrunfw and Linux kernel source
archives it was built from.

- smolvm (smol-machines/smolvm): Apache License 2.0.
- libkrun (smol-machines/libkrun): Apache License 2.0.
- libkrunfw (smol-machines/libkrunfw): LGPL-2.1-only, containing a Linux kernel
  under GPL-2.0-only.
- MoltenVK (KhronosGroup/MoltenVK): Apache License 2.0. macOS archives only.
- libepoxy (anholt/libepoxy): MIT License. macOS archives only.
- virglrenderer (freedesktop.org): MIT License. macOS archives only.
- Ubuntu Base and Node.js inside the Linux guest image; sources are pinned in
  scripts/release/inputs/linux-amd64-image-sources.json.

Go and JavaScript dependencies are listed in go.mod and protocol/package.json
and are distributed under their own licenses.
